error: Invalid package names

These are not valid package names:

  - gleam_otp@1 (Did you mean `gleam_otp`?)
  - lustre@4 (Did you mean `lustre`?)
  - Wibble

Package names must start with a lowercase letter and may only contain
lowercase letters, numbers and underscores.
